      "id": "tbl_0015",
      "reading_order": 289,
      "section": "Important information for ordering",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 142.78720092773438,
        "t": 366.6527099609375,
        "r": 558.9533081054688,
        "b": 211.1910400390625
      },
      "markdown": "| Nameplate     | Description                                                                                                                                                                                          |\n|---------------|------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|\n| Pump casing   | Provides information about the hydraulic characteristics of the pump. The formula for the pump size is: Discharge x Suction - Nominal Maximum Impeller Diameter in inches. (Example: 2x3-8)          |\n| Bearing frame | Provides information about the lubrication system used.                                                                                                                                              |\n| ATEX          | If applicable, your pump unit might have an ATEX nameplate affixed to the pump, the baseplate, or the discharge head. The nameplate provides information about the ATEX specifications of this pump. |\n| IECEx         | If applicable, your pump unit might have the following IECEx nameplate affixed to the pump and/or baseplate. The nameplate provides information about the IECEx specifications of this pump.         |",
